From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pulsar Bot <pulsar@localhost>
Date: Sat, 08 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] futex: implement futex_waitv syscall (nr 449)

Backport of sys_futex_waitv from Linux 5.16 adapted for the 4.19 CAF
single-file futex implementation (kernel/futex.c).

futex_waitv allows waiting on an array of up to 128 futexes in a single
syscall. Critical for Wine/ntsync: games batch waits on multiple sync
objects instead of N individual futex syscalls.

The implementation is appended to kernel/futex.c reusing existing
infrastructure: futex_wait_setup(), unqueue_me(), hrtimer_sleeper.

Signed-off-by: Pulsar Bot <pulsar@localhost>
---
 arch/arm64/include/asm/unistd32.h |   4 +
 include/linux/syscalls.h          |   4 +
 include/uapi/asm-generic/unistd.h |   4 +
 kernel/futex.c                    | 172 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 kernel/sys_ni.c                   |   1 +
 5 files changed, 185 insertions(+)

